      "text": "Braking burn. An engine push that slows a spacecraft down. ",
      "gender": "male",
      "url": "/story/audio/male/glossary/male-word-braking.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
      "sha256": "743d4362eccd6563dcba5d483f93d776035105c1c5cbf2249a1630d0c73a6943"
    },
    {
      "id": "word-burnwindow",
      "text": "Burn window. The right time to fire a spacecraft\u2019s engine. ",
      "gender": "male",
      "url": "/story/audio/male/glossary/male-word-burnwindow.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
      "sha256": "99b59eb186c12c108a419f5e485434dd61175af903130c3cf50cc49acdbfbce4"
    },
    {
      "id": "word-calibration",
      "text": "Calibration. Checking a tool so its readings are right. ",
      "gender": "male",
      "url": "/story/audio/male/glossary/male-word-calibration.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
      "sha256": "5c62030c4e137490d61dce5c509d64aaa8ca450b1c4411bdff423f1ff9f44986"
    },
    {
      "id": "word-coasting",
      "text": "Coasting. Moving through space with the engines turned off. ",
      "gender": "male",
      "url": "/story/audio/male/glossary/male-word-coasting.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
      "sha256": "3a8d3da27d0d96e1780e6c7ff1e9cd0cda26648bf3bbc270ef9e84f48f3468a5"
    },
    {
      "id": "word-contingency",
      "text": "Contingency. A backup plan for when something goes wrong. ",
      "gender": "male",
      "url": "/story/audio/male/glossary/male-word-contingency.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
      "sha256": "c557fb5e52436646b91df2214e037ab4e5915cdf524445891454cfc84a77901c"
    },
    {
      "id": "word-crewdays",
      "text": "Crew-days. A way to count supplies, where one person for one day uses one crew-day. ",
      "gender": "male",
      "url": "/story/audio/male/glossary/male-word-crewdays.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
      "sha256": "34e7d404c7e6f36f582d34283658f19a84b02efcba5985c98c4cd100e601f79f"
    },
    {
      "id": "word-crystalpattern",
      "text": "Crystal pattern. The repeating way tiny pieces fit together inside a crystal. ",
      "gender": "male",
      "url": "/story/audio/male/glossary/male-word-crystalpattern.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
      "sha256": "24e6b336f4f7ab423a6b5dbcf7f800d651b744af44944e817bc78ee97a054b48"
    },
    {
      "id": "word-deltav",
      "text": "Delta-v \u00b7 Change in speed. How much a spacecraft can change its speed or direction. ",
      "gender": "male",
      "url": "/story/audio/male/glossary/male-word-deltav.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
      "sha256": "2d8f457df7f0448e35d88d9faaa0ecf0b8c9e67abb00c576a05b7fa4a0698561"
    },
    {
      "id": "word-descent",
      "text": "Descent. Moving down toward the ground. ",
      "gender": "male",
      "url": "/story/audio/male/glossary/male-word-descent.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
      "sha256": "20d45f67c4e1c3623d2f54f7b231e12e69fbfba8aea1b209cf5c48d5c0dfe42a"
    },
    {
      "id": "word-drymass",
      "text": "Dry mass. How much a spacecraft and its cargo weigh without fuel. ",
      "gender": "male",
      "url": "/story/audio/male/glossary/male-word-drymass.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
      "sha256": "7ee0e082878e5060018d3e9a6a4073aa3a604aa99466999be9c47a43466f781c"
    },
    {
      "id": "word-ejecta",
      "text": "Crater ejecta. Rock and dust thrown out when something crashes into the ground. ",
      "gender": "male",
      "url": "/story/audio/male/glossary/male-word-ejecta.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
      "sha256": "44a1ca1109686bbe50ba4a9ec725f002e0d2eaabd8346e8ac68229e1b7b4f74b"
    },
    {
      "id": "word-ephemeris",
      "text": "Ephemeris. A timetable showing where planets and moons will be. ",
      "gender": "male",
      "url": "/story/audio/male/glossary/male-word-ephemeris.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
      "sha256": "b378ca270ed58d084624fdb97409954bf9d5ec88cab9688e062eef24d34b0246"
    },
    {
      "id": "word-escapetower",
      "text": "Escape tower. A small rocket that pulls the crew\u2019s cabin away from danger at launch. ",
      "gender": "male",
      "url": "/story/audio/male/glossary/male-word-escapetower.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
      "sha256": "b570f382bd3f1cd5975bff31392c404e34f4aacb5778ea6aaf3aa9c1924804a6"
    },
    {
      "id": "word-flyby",
      "text": "Flyby. Flying past a planet or moon without landing or staying there. ",
      "gender": "male",
      "url": "/story/audio/male/glossary/male-word-flyby.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
      "sha256": "9d17d50e1c0c107b4d039c7bcd1dad2bf88701ba43bfb7bd9dbd82cc8bf0bec7"
    },
    {
      "id": "word-highgain",
      "text": "High-gain communication. Sending a radio message in a narrow beam to reach far away. ",
      "gender": "male",
      "url": "/story/audio/male/glossary/male-word-highgain.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
      "sha256": "1158d7fc01a5340623515e57de463e5c0f00475005061d7f9dc0ab08248269b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "word-interpretation",
      "text": "Mineral interpretation. Using rock clues to work out what a rock is made of. ",
      "gender": "male",
      "url": "/story/audio/male/glossary/male-word-interpretation.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
      "sha256": "31f4ebb8234042f4b9e04bcdc55f0e1f44c9a8b3f478ab2d7c938029698b50a1"
    },
    {
      "id": "word-isp",
      "text": "Isp \u00b7 Specific impulse. A measure of how much push an engine gets from its fuel. ",
      "gender": "male",
      "url": "/story/audio/male/glossary/male-word-isp.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
      "sha256": "84c1769e62637b8fab57fe9985d2a798bd2f853d36c27010d6ec8e060d5dc55b"
    },
    {
      "id": "word-lunarcapture",
      "text": "Lunar capture. Slowing down near the Moon so the spacecraft stays around it. ",
      "gender": "male",
      "url": "/story/audio/male/glossary/male-word-lunarcapture.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
      "sha256": "4df3f7c1077ef815f3fe995954a89ed0eee6c8c5ec20653ac1df2d041ae210cd"
    },
    {
      "id": "word-lunarorbit",
      "text": "Lunar orbit. A path that goes around the Moon. ",
      "gender": "male",
      "url": "/story/audio/male/glossary/male-word-lunarorbit.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
      "sha256": "5fb19e89ea5bccd571af2d4df5a3766e5ad4aa1b77827cbe7ae663121a8e9f76"
    },
    {
      "id": "word-moontransfer",
      "text": "Moon transfer. The trip from a path around Earth to the Moon. ",
      "gender": "male",
      "url": "/story/audio/male/glossary/male-word-moontransfer.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
      "sha256": "edb2fdbea9c47bb282ee250eb00da615c063922b6e528bfe3370503a5d474e99"
    },
    {
      "id": "word-neutrons",
      "text": "Neutrons. Tiny pieces inside most atoms that can help us look for water clues. ",
      "gender": "male",
      "url": "/story/audio/male/glossary/male-word-neutrons.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
      "sha256": "68cd04110be885fee4301f3c534672926b641d96001ebba979e2f48884c7afed"
    },
    {
      "id": "word-parkingorbit",
      "text": "Earth parking orbit. A path around Earth where a spacecraft waits before flying farther. ",
      "gender": "male",
      "url": "/story/audio/male/glossary/male-word-parkingorbit.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
      "sha256": "17e7c23a445bcfcaa12ed2edbbdf177b8c6ddd5d7a639fdef427fee364669005"
    },
    {
      "id": "word-propellant",
      "text": "Propellant. The material a rocket throws out to push itself along. ",
      "gender": "male",
      "url": "/story/audio/male/glossary/male-word-propellant.mp3",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewNeural",
      "sha256": "5bca683507a9e0b7345a04d9c2cf46f7990e5bbfd90af6f5c944ded98e62b9f0"
    },
